# The console's own window is resized like the others: at 1920x1080 it is
# 221x56 characters at 70,74 (1780x932), its grip at 1836..1848, 992..1004.
# Pulling it in by 800 x 400 pixels leaves 121x31 characters; the shell
# goes on in it.
@usb kbd mouse
$ layout us
$ desktop
~ the terminal window has 221x56 characters
# The pointer starts in the middle (960,540).
@mouse 882 458
@button left down
@mouse -800 -400
@button left up
$ desktop
~ the terminal window has 121x31 characters
$ echo still here
still here
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1049,300=1f3a5f 1100,300=a8d0f0
